ource":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Main heroine of the story. Close friend of the protagonist. Together with Yuuji, attending the same seminar."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alongwith Tatsuhiko and Yuuji has been a trio of friends for a long time. Liked both of them as much but after getting confessed by Yuuji, started going out with him. However because of how busy Yuuji became, started to grow lonely."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"And thus, thinking about Tatsuhiko who is repressing his feelings, offered her virginity to him. Trapped by feelings of guilt, started having immoral sex with Tatsuhiko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62742"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・龍彦と主人公の親友・悠司とともに同じゼミに通うヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍彦・悠司とは昔から仲の良い3人組と評判だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2人のことを同じぐらいに好きだったが、悠司に告白されて彼と付き合うことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、なにかと忙しい悠司とのすれ違いに寂しさをつのらせていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、押さえつけていた龍彦への思いの末に、龍彦に処女を捧げてしまい、罪悪感に囚われ、龍彦との背徳的なセックスに身を任せるようになってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19804","sourceWorkId":"9555","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1e69c2ffc40763daa883cbe1fcf67dc1a1ae01b6743d0e32ab52f1c05fdc5dc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/259b4bd9aca96023f9f21644dfecf7c372b1f4314ddab47ed63f19cd5258b5ae.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日 アン","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:59067:120935:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62743","characterName":"杉原 静乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"120934","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"59067"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19805"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62743"},"originalCharacterName":"杉原 静乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is a junior of Tatsuhiko and others. Current seminar chief. Wears a rider suit which accentuates the body and also attracts gazes of male students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is it because of past trauma? Declares herself to be a misandrist. Because she is often seen with Katsura (who is also in same year as Tatsuhiko and others), rumors of being a homosexual is spread."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason, after knowing about the secret relationship between Tatsuhiko and Misaki, started harbouring feelings of disgust as well as conflicting feelings of curiosity regarding Tatsuhiko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62743"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍彦たちの後輩で、現ゼミ長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ボディラインがはっきりと映るライダースーツを着用し、男子学生の視線を集めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去のトラウマからか、男嫌いを公言し、龍彦と同級生の桂と一緒にいることが多いため、同性愛者という噂もたっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか、龍彦と美咲の秘密の関係を見抜き、龍彦に嫌悪と興味という相反する感情を抱くようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19805","sourceWorkId":"9555","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6d023d4c1e9c8c6987ec4569c12710c31dc55f95f8035cc32dbad10ae7eb9f6a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/3748df0bb6127f784a6ead3ef63b1f5a90997bcf28ac8f74b048c7ce789d7467.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石松千恵美","creatorId":"vndb:s1164","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1164","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1164","name":"石松 千恵美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:59067:120934:4273:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c62744","characterName":"福来 奈保","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"120933","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"59067"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19806"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62744"},"originalCharacterName":"福来 奈保","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is a staff of the university's student affairs office. She is also a graduate of the seminar, Tatsuhiko and others attend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a petite body with a baby face. Is popular as \"Lolita with big breasts\" among male students because of her childish behavior and huge breasts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although, had been going out with a boyfriend since her high school days, the relationship has turned into a rut. Dissatisfaction has started increasing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Treats Tatsuhiko as her younger brother. Occasionally puts on an air of a senior to push around people to do her work, but is secretly a masochist. While seemingly reluctant to Tatsuhiko's demands, obidiently follows it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62744"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学の学生課職員で、龍彦たちの通うゼミの卒業生でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"童顔で小柄、こどもっぽい言動に、似つかわしくない巨乳のため、男子学生からは『ロリ巨乳』として人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高校時代からつきあっている彼氏はいるものの、つきあいが惰性になっていると感じ、不満をつのらせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍彦を弟分と呼び、時には先輩風を吹かせながらこき使うが、実際は隠れMらしく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年下の龍彦が求むことには口ではいやといいながら従順に従う。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19806","sourceWorkId":"9555","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"